ART = '''<article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 my-8 prose prose-lg" data-slug="atopic-dermatitis-topical"><nav class="text-[12.5px] text-ink-500 mb-3" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href="/" class="hover:text-teal-700">首頁</a> · <a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-teal-700">衛教文章</a> · <span class="text-ink-700" data-zh="異位性皮膚炎外用治療" data-en="AD Topical Therapy">異位性皮膚炎外用治療</span></nav><div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-teal-700 font-semibold mb-2" data-zh="異膚 · 外用治療" data-en="Atopic Dermatitis · Topical Therapy">異膚 · 外用治療</div><h1 class="font-display font-bold text-[28px] sm:text-[36px] leading-tight text-ink-900 mb-3" data-zh="異位性皮膚炎外用治療完整指引 — 類固醇、TCI、PDE-4、JAK、Tapinarof" data-en="AD Topical Therapy — Corticosteroids, TCI, PDE-4, JAK, Tapinarof">異位性皮膚炎外用治療完整指引 — 類固醇、TCI、PDE-4、JAK、Tapinarof</h1><div class="text-[13.5px] text-ink-500 mb-6" data-zh="陳翊嘉 醫師 · 整合 Sidbury 2023 JAAD + Davis 2025 focused update + TFDA / 健保現況 · 更新 2026-05-14" data-en="Dr. Yi-Jia Chen · Integrating Sidbury 2023 JAAD + Davis 2025 focused update + TFDA/NHI status · Updated 2026-05-14">陳翊嘉 醫師 · 整合 Sidbury 2023 JAAD + Davis 2025 focused update + TFDA / 健保現況 · 更新 2026-05-14</div>

<div class="dn-tldr" style="background:#fefce8;border-left:4px solid #ca8a04;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:14px 18px;margin:18px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85"><strong data-zh="一句話結論" data-en="TL;DR">一句話結論</strong>:<span data-zh="外用治療仍是異膚的基石。AAD 2023 給予「強建議」的有保濕、外用類固醇、TCI、外用 PDE-4(Crisaborole)、外用 JAK(Ruxolitinib);2025 update 加入 Tapinarof(VTAMA)+ Roflumilast 0.15%(ZORYVE)。漂白水泡澡 + wet wrap 是「條件式建議」、外用抗生素 / 抗組織胺則「條件式不建議」。" data-en="Topical therapy remains the cornerstone of AD care. AAD 2023 strongly recommends moisturizers, topical corticosteroids, TCIs, topical PDE-4 (crisaborole), and topical JAK (ruxolitinib); 2025 update adds tapinarof (VTAMA) and roflumilast 0.15% (ZORYVE). Bleach baths and wet-wrap therapy are conditional FOR; topical antimicrobials and antihistamines are conditional AGAINST.">外用治療仍是異膚的基石。AAD 2023 給予「強建議」的有保濕、外用類固醇、TCI、外用 PDE-4(Crisaborole)、外用 JAK(Ruxolitinib);2025 update 加入 Tapinarof(VTAMA)+ Roflumilast 0.15%(ZORYVE)。漂白水泡澡 + wet wrap 是「條件式建議」、外用抗生素 / 抗組織胺則「條件式不建議」。</span></div>

<h2 id="moisturizer" data-zh="一、保濕劑(emollient)— 強建議,治療地基" data-en="1. Moisturizers — strong recommendation, foundation of therapy">一、保濕劑(emollient)— 強建議,治療地基</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>機轉</strong>:減少經皮水分流失(TEWL)、修復屏障、減少 AD severity 與發作頻率" data-en="<strong>Mechanism</strong>: reduces transepidermal water loss (TEWL), repairs barrier, decreases AD severity and flare frequency"><strong>機轉</strong>:減少經皮水分流失(TEWL)、修復屏障、減少 AD severity 與發作頻率</li><li data-zh="<strong>建議成分</strong>:神經醯胺(ceramide-3, NS, AP)、膽固醇、脂肪酸 — 比例 3:1:1 最接近健康屏障" data-en="<strong>Recommended ingredients</strong>: ceramides (ceramide-3, NS, AP), cholesterol, fatty acids in 3:1:1 ratio (closest to healthy barrier composition)"><strong>建議成分</strong>:神經醯胺(ceramide-3, NS, AP)、膽固醇、脂肪酸 — 比例 3:1:1 最接近健康屏障</li><li data-zh="<strong>用法</strong>:洗澡後 3 分鐘內厚塗;每天 ≥ 2 次;成人 ~250-500 g/週,兒童按比例" data-en="<strong>Usage</strong>: thick application within 3 minutes of bathing; ≥ 2 times daily; adults ~250–500 g/week, children proportionally"><strong>用法</strong>:洗澡後 3 分鐘內厚塗;每天 ≥ 2 次;成人 ~250-500 g/週,兒童按比例</li><li data-zh="<strong>避免</strong>:含香料、酒精、防腐劑(MI / MCI、formaldehyde 釋放劑) — 過敏率高" data-en="<strong>Avoid</strong>: fragrances, alcohol, preservatives (MI/MCI, formaldehyde releasers) — high allergy rate"><strong>避免</strong>:含香料、酒精、防腐劑(MI / MCI、formaldehyde 釋放劑) — 過敏率高</li><li data-zh="<strong>常見產品(台灣)</strong>:理膚寶水 Lipikar AP+M、艾芙美 Avene Xeracalm、艾惟諾 Aveeno、Cetaphil、CeraVe、Eucerin AtoControl" data-en="<strong>Common products (Taiwan)</strong>: La Roche-Posay Lipikar AP+M, Avène Xeracalm, Aveeno, Cetaphil, CeraVe, Eucerin AtoControl"><strong>常見產品(台灣)</strong>:理膚寶水 Lipikar AP+M、艾芙美 Avene Xeracalm、艾惟諾 Aveeno、Cetaphil、CeraVe、Eucerin AtoControl</li></ul>

<h2 id="tcs" data-zh="二、外用類固醇(TCS)— 強建議,7 級分級系統" data-en="2. Topical corticosteroids (TCS) — strong recommendation, 7-class system">二、外用類固醇(TCS)— 強建議,7 級分級系統</h2><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;margin:14px 0"><thead><tr style="background:#ebe4d8"><th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8;text-align:left" data-zh="級別" data-en="Class">級別</th><th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="效力" data-en="Potency">效力</th><th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="代表藥物" data-en="Representative">代表藥物</th><th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="適用" data-en="Use">適用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8">I</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="超強效" data-en="Super-potent">超強效</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8">Clobetasol propionate 0.05%, Halobetasol</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="重度苔癬化、手足慢性病灶;不可用於臉部/皺褶/兒童" data-en="Severe lichenification, chronic palmoplantar; never on face/folds/children">重度苔癬化、手足慢性病灶;不可用於臉部/皺褶/兒童</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8">II–III</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="強效" data-en="High">強效</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8">Betamethasone dipropionate, Mometasone furoate, Fluocinonide</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="軀幹四肢急性發作、限期 2-4 週" data-en="Trunk/extremity acute flares, time-limited 2–4 weeks">軀幹四肢急性發作、限期 2-4 週</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8">IV–V</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="中效" data-en="Medium">中效</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8">Triamcinolone 0.1%, Fluticasone 0.05%, Clocortolone</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="軀幹維持、proactive therapy 每週 2 次" data-en="Trunk maintenance, proactive therapy 2×/week">軀幹維持、proactive therapy 每週 2 次</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8">VI–VII</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="低效 - 弱效" data-en="Low – weak">低效 - 弱效</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8">Hydrocortisone 1-2.5%, Desonide 0.05%</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="臉、生殖器、嬰幼兒、皺褶處" data-en="Face, genitalia, infants, intertriginous areas">臉、生殖器、嬰幼兒、皺褶處</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li data-zh="<strong>用量單位 — Fingertip Unit (FTU)</strong>:從食指末端關節到指尖的藥膏量(~0.5 g)。可塗 2 個手掌大小的面積" data-en="<strong>Fingertip Unit (FTU)</strong>: amount of cream from the distal interphalangeal joint to the fingertip (~0.5 g); covers ~2 adult palms"><strong>用量單位 — Fingertip Unit (FTU)</strong>:從食指末端關節到指尖的藥膏量(~0.5 g)。可塗 2 個手掌大小的面積</li><li data-zh="<strong>急性期</strong>:每天 1-2 次,持續到病灶平整 + 不癢(通常 2-4 週)" data-en="<strong>Acute phase</strong>: 1–2 times daily until lesions flatten and itch resolves (typically 2–4 weeks)"><strong>急性期</strong>:每天 1-2 次,持續到病灶平整 + 不癢(通常 2-4 週)</li><li data-zh="<strong>Proactive therapy</strong>:在「過去常發作」的部位每週 2 次外用低-中效類固醇,可顯著降低復發率(Hanifin 2002 RCT)" data-en="<strong>Proactive therapy</strong>: low-mid potency steroid 2×/week to historically affected sites significantly reduces flare rate (Hanifin 2002 RCT)"><strong>Proactive therapy</strong>:在「過去常發作」的部位每週 2 次外用低-中效類固醇,可顯著降低復發率(Hanifin 2002 RCT)</li><li data-zh="<strong>類固醇恐懼症(steroid phobia)</strong>:50-80% AD 病人有,需主動衛教。正確使用下副作用罕見;停藥反彈與「類固醇戒斷症候群(TSW)」不適用於有醫師指導下的標準療程" data-en="<strong>Steroid phobia</strong>: present in 50–80% of AD patients; requires proactive education. Side effects are rare with proper use; rebound and TSW are unrelated to physician-guided standard regimens"><strong>類固醇恐懼症(steroid phobia)</strong>:50-80% AD 病人有,需主動衛教。正確使用下副作用罕見;停藥反彈與「類固醇戒斷症候群(TSW)」不適用於有醫師指導下的標準療程</li><li data-zh="<strong>副作用</strong>:皮膚萎縮、紋路、紫斑、毛囊炎、口周皮炎(臉部)、TC 反彈;嬰幼兒大面積 / 長期使用罕見會吸收影響 HPA 軸" data-en="<strong>Adverse effects</strong>: skin atrophy, striae, purpura, folliculitis, perioral dermatitis (face), tachyphylaxis; rare HPA-axis suppression with extensive prolonged infant use"><strong>副作用</strong>:皮膚萎縮、紋路、紫斑、毛囊炎、口周皮炎(臉部)、TC 反彈;嬰幼兒大面積 / 長期使用罕見會吸收影響 HPA 軸</li></ul>

<h2 id="tci" data-zh="三、外用 Calcineurin 抑制劑(TCI)— 強建議,類固醇備用替代" data-en="3. Topical calcineurin inhibitors (TCI) — strong recommendation, steroid-sparing">三、外用 Calcineurin 抑制劑(TCI)— 強建議,類固醇備用替代</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>Tacrolimus 0.03%(兒童) / 0.1%(成人)</strong>(普特皮 Protopic):較強效,適合 ≥ 2 歲" data-en="<strong>Tacrolimus 0.03% (children) / 0.1% (adults)</strong> (Protopic): more potent; suitable for ≥ 2 years"><strong>Tacrolimus 0.03%(兒童) / 0.1%(成人)</strong>(普特皮 Protopic):較強效,適合 ≥ 2 歲</li><li data-zh="<strong>Pimecrolimus 1%</strong>(醫立妥 Elidel):較溫和,適合 ≥ 2 歲" data-en="<strong>Pimecrolimus 1%</strong> (Elidel): milder; suitable for ≥ 2 years"><strong>Pimecrolimus 1%</strong>(醫立妥 Elidel):較溫和,適合 ≥ 2 歲</li><li data-zh="<strong>適合部位</strong>:臉、眼周、生殖器、皺褶處 — 不會皮膚萎縮" data-en="<strong>Best sites</strong>: face, periocular, genitalia, folds — does not cause skin atrophy"><strong>適合部位</strong>:臉、眼周、生殖器、皺褶處 — 不會皮膚萎縮</li><li data-zh="<strong>常見副作用</strong>:塗藥部位灼熱、刺痛(前 1-2 週,逐漸耐受);可能輕微紅斑" data-en="<strong>Common AEs</strong>: application-site burning, stinging (first 1–2 weeks, then tolerance develops); mild erythema possible"><strong>常見副作用</strong>:塗藥部位灼熱、刺痛(前 1-2 週,逐漸耐受);可能輕微紅斑</li><li data-zh="<strong>FDA black box warning(已大幅軟化)</strong>:理論性致癌(無人體實證);Asgari 2020 大型 cohort 未顯示致癌增加。AAD 2023 強建議使用,認為 box warning 證據基礎薄弱" data-en="<strong>FDA black box warning (substantially softened)</strong>: theoretical malignancy concern (no human-data confirmation); Asgari 2020 large cohort showed no increase. AAD 2023 strongly recommends use; box warning has weak evidence basis"><strong>FDA black box warning(已大幅軟化)</strong>:理論性致癌(無人體實證);Asgari 2020 大型 cohort 未顯示致癌增加。AAD 2023 強建議使用,認為 box warning 證據基礎薄弱</li><li data-zh="<strong>Proactive use</strong>:每週 2 次塗易發作部位,可長期維持" data-en="<strong>Proactive use</strong>: 2×/week to flare-prone sites for long-term maintenance"><strong>Proactive use</strong>:每週 2 次塗易發作部位,可長期維持</li></ul>

<h2 id="pde4" data-zh="四、外用 PDE-4 抑制劑 — Crisaborole + Roflumilast(2025 新)" data-en="4. Topical PDE-4 inhibitors — Crisaborole + Roflumilast (2025 new)">四、外用 PDE-4 抑制劑 — Crisaborole + Roflumilast(2025 新)</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>Crisaborole 2%</strong>(EUCRISA):FDA 核准 ≥ 3 個月嬰兒輕度-中度 AD;每天 2 次。常見副作用:塗藥部位疼痛(4-6%)、超敏反應" data-en="<strong>Crisaborole 2%</strong> (EUCRISA): FDA-approved for mild-moderate AD ≥ 3 months; twice daily. Common AEs: application-site pain (4–6%), hypersensitivity"><strong>Crisaborole 2%</strong>(EUCRISA):FDA 核准 ≥ 3 個月嬰兒輕度-中度 AD;每天 2 次。常見副作用:塗藥部位疼痛(4-6%)、超敏反應</li><li data-zh="<strong>Roflumilast 0.15% cream</strong>(ZORYVE — 2025 update 強建議):FDA 2024-07 核准 ≥ 6 歲輕度-中度 AD;每天 1 次。INTEGUMENT-1/2 vIGA-AD success 32-39% vs 賦形劑 9-13%。AAD 高度確定性證據" data-en="<strong>Roflumilast 0.15% cream</strong> (ZORYVE — 2025 update strong recommendation): FDA-approved July 2024 for mild-moderate AD ≥ 6 years; once daily. INTEGUMENT-1/2 vIGA-AD success 32–39% vs vehicle 9–13%. AAD high-certainty evidence"><strong>Roflumilast 0.15% cream</strong>(ZORYVE — 2025 update 強建議):FDA 2024-07 核准 ≥ 6 歲輕度-中度 AD;每天 1 次。INTEGUMENT-1/2 vIGA-AD success 32-39% vs 賦形劑 9-13%。AAD 高度確定性證據</li><li data-zh="<strong>0.15% AD vs 0.3% 乾癬</strong>:濃度不同、別搞混" data-en="<strong>0.15% AD vs 0.3% psoriasis</strong>: different strengths, do not confuse"><strong>0.15% AD vs 0.3% 乾癬</strong>:濃度不同、別搞混</li><li data-zh="<strong>定位</strong>:適合不耐受類固醇 / TCI、需長期維持非類固醇選項" data-en="<strong>Positioning</strong>: suitable for steroid/TCI-intolerant or for long-term non-steroidal maintenance"><strong>定位</strong>:適合不耐受類固醇 / TCI、需長期維持非類固醇選項</li></ul>

<h2 id="jak" data-zh="五、外用 JAK 抑制劑 — Ruxolitinib" data-en="5. Topical JAK inhibitor — Ruxolitinib">五、外用 JAK 抑制劑 — Ruxolitinib</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>Ruxolitinib 1.5% cream</strong>(OPZELURA):FDA 核准 ≥ 12 歲短期非連續性 AD,輕度-中度,每天 2 次,連續 ≤ 8 週" data-en="<strong>Ruxolitinib 1.5% cream</strong> (OPZELURA): FDA-approved short-term non-continuous use for AD ≥ 12 years, mild-moderate, twice daily, ≤ 8 weeks"><strong>Ruxolitinib 1.5% cream</strong>(OPZELURA):FDA 核准 ≥ 12 歲短期非連續性 AD,輕度-中度,每天 2 次,連續 ≤ 8 週</li><li data-zh="<strong>療效</strong>:TRuE-AD1/2 — 8 週 IGA 0/1 + ≥ 2 點下降達 50-54% vs 賦形劑 ~ 15%" data-en="<strong>Efficacy</strong>: TRuE-AD1/2 — IGA 0/1 with ≥ 2-point drop at 8 weeks: 50–54% vs vehicle ~15%"><strong>療效</strong>:TRuE-AD1/2 — 8 週 IGA 0/1 + ≥ 2 點下降達 50-54% vs 賦形劑 ~ 15%</li><li data-zh="<strong>FDA boxed warning</strong>:雖然外用全身吸收極少,仍 carry 全身性 JAK class warning(MACE / VTE / 嚴重感染 / 惡性腫瘤)" data-en="<strong>FDA boxed warning</strong>: despite minimal systemic absorption, still carries the systemic JAK class warning (MACE / VTE / serious infection / malignancy)"><strong>FDA boxed warning</strong>:雖然外用全身吸收極少,仍 carry 全身性 JAK class warning(MACE / VTE / 嚴重感染 / 惡性腫瘤)</li><li data-zh="<strong>限制</strong>:塗布面積 ≤ 20% BSA、避免合併其他生物製劑 / 系統 JAK / 免疫抑制劑" data-en="<strong>Restrictions</strong>: ≤ 20% BSA application; avoid concurrent biologics/systemic JAK/immunosuppressants"><strong>限制</strong>:塗布面積 ≤ 20% BSA、避免合併其他生物製劑 / 系統 JAK / 免疫抑制劑</li></ul>

<h2 id="tapinarof" data-zh="六、外用 AhR 激動劑 — Tapinarof(2025 新強建議)" data-en="6. Topical aryl hydrocarbon receptor (AhR) agonist — Tapinarof (2025 new strong recommendation)">六、外用 AhR 激動劑 — Tapinarof(2025 新強建議)</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>Tapinarof 1% cream</strong>(VTAMA):FDA 2024-12 核准 ≥ 2 歲異膚;每天 1 次" data-en="<strong>Tapinarof 1% cream</strong> (VTAMA): FDA-approved December 2024 for AD ≥ 2 years; once daily"><strong>Tapinarof 1% cream</strong>(VTAMA):FDA 2024-12 核准 ≥ 2 歲異膚;每天 1 次</li><li data-zh="<strong>機轉</strong>:芳香烴受體(AhR)激動劑、降低 Th17 / Th2 細胞激素、強化屏障蛋白表達" data-en="<strong>Mechanism</strong>: aryl hydrocarbon receptor agonist; reduces Th17/Th2 cytokines; enhances barrier-protein expression"><strong>機轉</strong>:芳香烴受體(AhR)激動劑、降低 Th17 / Th2 細胞激素、強化屏障蛋白表達</li><li data-zh="<strong>療效</strong>:8 週試驗 IGA 0/1 + EASI-75 顯著優於賦形劑;改善程度中等" data-en="<strong>Efficacy</strong>: 8-week trials show IGA 0/1 and EASI-75 significantly superior to vehicle; moderate improvement"><strong>療效</strong>:8 週試驗 IGA 0/1 + EASI-75 顯著優於賦形劑;改善程度中等</li><li data-zh="<strong>常見副作用</strong>:毛囊炎(~17%)、頭痛、塗藥部位疼痛" data-en="<strong>Common AEs</strong>: folliculitis (~17%), headache, application-site pain"><strong>常見副作用</strong>:毛囊炎(~17%)、頭痛、塗藥部位疼痛</li><li data-zh="<strong>定位</strong>:不像類固醇有皮膚萎縮疑慮、可長期使用;特別適合臉部、皺褶等敏感區域" data-en="<strong>Positioning</strong>: no skin-atrophy concern unlike steroids; suitable for long-term use; particularly good for face, folds, sensitive areas"><strong>定位</strong>:不像類固醇有皮膚萎縮疑慮、可長期使用;特別適合臉部、皺褶等敏感區域</li></ul>

<h2 id="bathing" data-zh="七、洗澡與漂白水泡澡(條件式建議)" data-en="7. Bathing and bleach baths (conditional recommendations)">七、洗澡與漂白水泡澡(條件式建議)</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>洗澡</strong>:每天 1 次、5-10 分鐘、溫水(不超過 37°C)、無皂鹼合成清潔劑(syndet);洗完 3 分鐘內保濕" data-en="<strong>Bathing</strong>: once daily, 5–10 min, lukewarm water (≤ 37°C), syndet (synthetic detergent, soap-free); moisturize within 3 min of bathing"><strong>洗澡</strong>:每天 1 次、5-10 分鐘、溫水(不超過 37°C)、無皂鹼合成清潔劑(syndet);洗完 3 分鐘內保濕</li><li data-zh="<strong>漂白水泡澡(diluted bleach bath)</strong>:0.005% NaClO(0.5 杯漂白水 / 滿浴缸 ~150 L);每週 2 次、每次 5-10 分鐘;降低 S aureus、減少感染" data-en="<strong>Diluted bleach bath</strong>: 0.005% NaClO (0.5 cup bleach / full bathtub ~150 L); twice weekly, 5–10 min; reduces S aureus and secondary infection"><strong>漂白水泡澡(diluted bleach bath)</strong>:0.005% NaClO(0.5 杯漂白水 / 滿浴缸 ~150 L);每週 2 次、每次 5-10 分鐘;降低 S aureus、減少感染</li><li data-zh="<strong>2023 AAD 強度</strong>:洗澡頻率為 conditional FOR;漂白水泡澡為 conditional FOR;適合中重度頻繁感染者" data-en="<strong>2023 AAD strength</strong>: bathing frequency conditional FOR; bleach baths conditional FOR; recommended for moderate-severe AD with frequent infection"><strong>2023 AAD 強度</strong>:洗澡頻率為 conditional FOR;漂白水泡澡為 conditional FOR;適合中重度頻繁感染者</li></ul>

<h2 id="wet-wrap" data-zh="八、Wet Wrap Therapy(濕敷療法,條件式建議)" data-en="8. Wet wrap therapy (conditional recommendation)">八、Wet Wrap Therapy(濕敷療法,條件式建議)</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>原理</strong>:外用類固醇 / TCI 後,先濕紗布、再乾紗布包覆 — 增加吸收、降溫、減少抓癢、保護屏障" data-en="<strong>Principle</strong>: after applying topical steroid/TCI, wrap with damp gauze covered by dry layer — enhances penetration, cools skin, prevents scratching, protects barrier"><strong>原理</strong>:外用類固醇 / TCI 後,先濕紗布、再乾紗布包覆 — 增加吸收、降溫、減少抓癢、保護屏障</li><li data-zh="<strong>適合</strong>:中重度急性發作、住院或專科指導下短期使用(3-7 天)" data-en="<strong>Indications</strong>: moderate-severe acute flares, short-term (3–7 days) under specialist or inpatient supervision"><strong>適合</strong>:中重度急性發作、住院或專科指導下短期使用(3-7 天)</li><li data-zh="<strong>注意</strong>:強效類固醇下 wet wrap 增加吸收 → 兒童大面積使用需注意系統性副作用;需專科指導" data-en="<strong>Caution</strong>: high-potency steroid + wet wrap increases absorption → monitor for systemic effects in children with extensive use; specialist supervision required"><strong>注意</strong>:強效類固醇下 wet wrap 增加吸收 → 兒童大面積使用需注意系統性副作用;需專科指導</li></ul>

<h2 id="against" data-zh="九、AAD 2023 「條件式不建議」的選項" data-en="9. AAD 2023 conditional AGAINST options">九、AAD 2023 「條件式不建議」的選項</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>外用抗生素 / 抗微生物 / 抗菌劑</strong>(例如 mupirocin、chlorhexidine):無感染證據時不建議常規預防;不能取代漂白水泡澡的菌群調節作用" data-en="<strong>Topical antibiotics / antimicrobials / antiseptics</strong> (e.g., mupirocin, chlorhexidine): not recommended for routine prophylaxis without evidence of infection; cannot replace the microbiome-modulating effect of bleach baths"><strong>外用抗生素 / 抗微生物 / 抗菌劑</strong>(例如 mupirocin、chlorhexidine):無感染證據時不建議常規預防;不能取代漂白水泡澡的菌群調節作用</li><li data-zh="<strong>外用抗組織胺</strong>(diphenhydramine、doxepin):止癢效益小、過敏接觸性皮膚炎風險高、特別兒童中容易吸收造成嗜睡 / 尿滯留" data-en="<strong>Topical antihistamines</strong> (diphenhydramine, doxepin): limited antipruritic benefit, high contact dermatitis risk, systemic absorption in children may cause sedation/urinary retention"><strong>外用抗組織胺</strong>(diphenhydramine、doxepin):止癢效益小、過敏接觸性皮膚炎風險高、特別兒童中容易吸收造成嗜睡 / 尿滯留</li><li data-zh="<strong>含抗生素的類固醇複方</strong>:Sidbury 2023 不建議常規使用;有特定明確細菌感染時才用單方抗生素" data-en="<strong>Steroid-antibiotic combinations</strong>: Sidbury 2023 advises against routine use; use single-agent antibiotics only for specific identified bacterial infection"><strong>含抗生素的類固醇複方</strong>:Sidbury 2023 不建議常規使用;有特定明確細菌感染時才用單方抗生素</li></ul>

<h2 id="practical" data-zh="十、實務治療階段策略" data-en="10. Practical treatment-stage strategy">十、實務治療階段策略</h2><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;margin:14px 0"><thead><tr style="background:#ebe4d8"><th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8;text-align:left" data-zh="嚴重度 / 階段" data-en="Severity / phase">嚴重度 / 階段</th><th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="第一線" data-en="First-line">第一線</th><th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="替代 / 加強" data-en="Alternative / step-up">替代 / 加強</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="輕度緩解期" data-en="Mild / maintenance">輕度緩解期</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="保濕 + 避免誘發因子" data-en="Moisturizer + trigger avoidance">保濕 + 避免誘發因子</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="低效 TCS / TCI proactive 每週 2 次" data-en="Low-potency TCS / TCI proactive 2×/week">低效 TCS / TCI proactive 每週 2 次</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="輕度急性發作" data-en="Mild acute flare">輕度急性發作</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="低-中效 TCS 每天 1-2 次,2-4 週" data-en="Low-mid potency TCS 1–2×/day, 2–4 weeks">低-中效 TCS 每天 1-2 次,2-4 週</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="TCI(臉/皺褶/眼周)、Roflumilast、Tapinarof" data-en="TCI (face/folds/periocular), roflumilast, tapinarof">TCI(臉/皺褶/眼周)、Roflumilast、Tapinarof</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="中度急性發作" data-en="Moderate acute flare">中度急性發作</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="中-高效 TCS 每天 2 次,2-4 週" data-en="Mid-high potency TCS 2×/day, 2–4 weeks">中-高效 TCS 每天 2 次,2-4 週</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="加 wet wrap、Ruxolitinib(短期 8 週)、漂白水泡澡 2×/週" data-en="Add wet wrap, ruxolitinib (short-term 8 weeks), bleach baths 2×/week">加 wet wrap、Ruxolitinib(短期 8 週)、漂白水泡澡 2×/週</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="重度 / 頑固性" data-en="Severe / refractory">重度 / 頑固性</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="繼續優化外用 + 升階全身治療" data-en="Continue optimized topical + step up to systemic">繼續優化外用 + 升階全身治療</td><td style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #dcd5c8" data-zh="生物製劑 / JAK / 光療 — 詳見 <a href='/blog/atopic-dermatitis-systemic' style='color:#0c5159;text-decoration:underline'>系統治療文章</a>" data-en="Biologics / JAK / phototherapy — see <a href='/blog/atopic-dermatitis-systemic' style='color:#0c5159;text-decoration:underline'>systemic article</a>">生物製劑 / JAK / 光療 — 詳見 <a href='/blog/atopic-dermatitis-systemic' style='color:#0c5159;text-decoration:underline'>系統治療文章</a></td></tr></tbody></table>

<h2 id="taiwan-status" data-zh="台灣現況(2026)" data-en="Taiwan status (2026)">台灣現況(2026)</h2><ul><li data-zh="<strong>健保給付</strong>:多數 TCS、Tacrolimus / Pimecrolimus、Crisaborole(部分條件)" data-en="<strong>NHI-covered</strong>: most TCS, tacrolimus/pimecrolimus, crisaborole (conditional)"><strong>健保給付</strong>:多數 TCS、Tacrolimus / Pimecrolimus、Crisaborole(部分條件)</li><li data-zh="<strong>TFDA 已核可、健保未給付(自費)</strong>:Ruxolitinib cream、Roflumilast 0.15%、Tapinarof 1% — 各約每條 NT$ 2,000-4,000" data-en="<strong>TFDA-approved, NHI not reimbursed</strong>: ruxolitinib cream, roflumilast 0.15%, tapinarof 1% — approximately NT$ 2,000–4,000 per tube"><strong>TFDA 已核可、健保未給付(自費)</strong>:Ruxolitinib cream、Roflumilast 0.15%、Tapinarof 1% — 各約每條 NT$ 2,000-4,000</li></ul>

<h2 id="references" data-zh="參考資料" data-en="References">參考資料</h2><ol style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.8"><li>Sidbury R, Alikhan A, Bercovitch L, et al. <em>Guidelines of care for the management of atopic dermatitis in adults with topical therapies.</em> J Am Acad Dermatol. 2023;89(1):e1-e20.</li><li>Davis DMR, Frazer-Green L, Alikhan A, et al. <em>Focused update: Guidelines of care for the management of atopic dermatitis in adults.</em> J Am Acad Dermatol. 2025;93(3):745.e1-e7.</li><li>Hanifin JM, Reed ML; Eczema Prevalence and Impact Working Group. <em>A population-based survey of eczema prevalence in the United States.</em> Dermatitis. 2007;18:82-91.</li><li>Wollenberg A, Reitamo S, Atzori F, et al. <em>Proactive treatment of atopic dermatitis in adults with 0.1% tacrolimus ointment.</em> Allergy. 2008;63:742-750.</li><li>Asgari MM, Tsai AL, Avalos L, et al. <em>Association between topical calcineurin inhibitor use and keratinocyte carcinoma risk among adults with atopic dermatitis.</em> JAMA Dermatol. 2020;156:1066-1073.</li><li>Simpson EL, Eichenfield LF, Alonso-Llamazares J, et al. <em>Roflumilast cream, 0.15%, for atopic dermatitis: INTEGUMENT-1/2 trials.</em> JAMA Dermatol. 2024;160:1161-1170.</li><li>Paller AS, Stein Gold L, Soung J, et al. <em>Phase 2b trial of tapinarof cream for atopic dermatitis.</em> J Drugs Dermatol. 2023;22:139-147.</li></ol></article>'''

s = re.sub(r'<article[^>]*data-slug="eczema-myths"[\s\S]*?</article>', ART, s, count=1)

with open(P, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:
    f.write(s)
print(f'Wrote AD topical article: {len(s)} bytes')
